loi_giai:
a) $\int (x-2)^{2}\ dx=\frac{x^{3}}{3}-2x^{2}+4x+C$;
b) $\int (x-1)(3x+1)dx=x^{3}-x^{2}-x+C$;
c) $\int \sqrt[3]{x^{2}}\ dx=\int x^{\frac{2}{3}}\ dx=\frac{3}{5}x^{\frac{5}{3}}+C=\frac{3}{5}x\cdot\sqrt[3]{x^{2}}+C$;
d) $\int \frac{(1-x)^{2}}{\sqrt{x}}\ dx=\int \frac{1-2x+x^{2}}{\sqrt{x}}\ dx=\int \left( \frac{1}{\sqrt{x}}-2\sqrt{x}+x\sqrt{x} \right)dx$
$\begin{array}{l} =\int \left( x^{-\frac{1}{2}}-2x^{\frac{1}{2}}+x^{\frac{3}{2}} \right)dx=2x^{\frac{1}{2}}-2\cdot\frac{2}{3}x^{\frac{3}{2}}+\frac{2}{5}x^{\frac{5}{2}}+C \\ =2\sqrt{x}-\frac{4}{3}x\sqrt{x}+\frac{2}{5}x^{2}\sqrt{x}+C \end{array}$

noi_dung:
(CTST12) Tìm:
a) $\int \left( 5^{x}+1 \right)\left( 5^{x}-1 \right)dx$;
b) $\int e^{-0,5x}\ dx$;
c) $\int 2^{x-1}\cdot 5^{2x+1}\ dx$.

loi_giai:
a) $\int \left( 5^{x}+1 \right)\left( 5^{x}-1 \right)dx=\int \left( 25^{x}-1 \right)dx=\frac{25^{x}}{\ln 25}-x+C=\frac{25^{x}}{2\ln 5}-x+C$
b) $\int e^{-0,5x}\ dx=\int \left( e^{-0,5} \right)^{x}\ dx=\frac{\left( e^{-0,5} \right)^{x}}{\ln e^{-0,5}}+C=\frac{e^{-0,5x}}{-0,5}+C=-2e^{-0,5x}+C$;
c) $\int 2^{x-1}\cdot 5^{2x+1}\ dx=\int \frac{2^{x}}{2}\cdot 5\cdot 25^{x}\ dx=\frac{5}{2}\int 50^{x}\ dx=\frac{5}{2}\cdot\frac{50^{x}}{\ln 50}+C$.

